{
  "_note": "Config snapshot for exp-007 (issue #15 / ADR 0022): CPU-side retrieval artifact production for the two runnable hop-matched-retrieval conditions (mixed, oracle-hop-matched) over the ADR 0007 pinned 600 (200/hop). Router-hop-matched is not attempted (ADR 0022 item 5/Consequences: no predictions file, today's router writes no query id). Committed config files were not edited; MusiQue/scripts/check_question_similarity.py -> truncate_top20.py -> rerank_similarity_results.py were invoked directly (not via an orchestrator), per launcher runs/exp-007/run_cpu_stages.sh.",

